    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "シテ尤長崎ヨリ迎取候船中入費共如斯"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "…にして、尤（もっと）も長崎より迎ひ取り候（そうろう）船中（せんちゅう）入費も共に斯（か）くの如し"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "...and likewise the shipboard expenses of the vessels sent from Nagasaki to collect them are also as thus [shown]."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
