  {
    "id": "anno-tsushima_upper_p017_left-09",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "〃 自他漂民本藩ヨリ朝鮮國に送還之節船中相與候飯米鹽噌代右"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "同じく、自他の漂民を本藩より朝鮮国（ちょうせんこく）に送還（そうかん）の節（せつ）、船中にて相与へ候飯米・塩噌代、右（同断）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "ditto  For castaways from this and other domains, at the time of repatriating them from this domain to Korea, the rice-provisions and salt-and-miso costs supplied aboard ship; [same as] the above."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "〃 自他漂民本藩ヨリ朝鮮國に送還之節船中相與候飯米鹽噌代右"
